  <header>
    <h1>Virtual Reality & Augmented Reality with 6G Communication</h1>

    <p>
      Exploring how Artificial Intelligence, Virtual Reality (VR), 
      Augmented Reality (AR), and future 6G communication networks 
      will reshape education, healthcare, entertainment, remote work, 
      and global collaboration by 2040.
    </p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#overview">Overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="#6g">6G Technology</a></li>
